 "notes": "Route-comparison paper with two spine branches from reactive hot pressing (one synthesis node, concurrent_forming per v03 #21): strength (porosity -> bending) and wear (incomplete reaction / interface -> wear mode -> COF, wear rate). t11 STR/interface is basis=attributed but also evidenced indirectly by pothole signatures (o8, proxy). Audit o10: F2 shows no graphite reflection while the wear advantage is attributed to residual graphite. F5 error bars make several pairwise rankings non-significant (o7 partial). F3 shows pores arrowed also in TTT-1300 C panels. F1, F4, F6, F7 not opened (read budget): their OBS are text_only with fig_ref. Lost: modulus/hardness numbers, density table, TEM details.",
 "migrated_from": "r04/graphs/Materials_Characterization__j.matchar.2018.04.010.json"
}